    - target: {fileID: 915132101154549691, guid: 351d4bd8fcb2349dca7a6973c898570b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'He left me

        And I will never believe

        It had to be
        that way

        ...

        He was fine before\r\nWe were whole before\r\nNo
        more soft steps beside me\r\nNo more games in the sun

        ...

        The
        light he left me

        Will never outshine

        The darkness that
        took his place'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
